*KEYWORD
$
$===============================================================================
$===============================================================================
$ Use the main `run.key` to start the simulation
$
$ This include defines the information required to run rear impact Yoganandan et 
$ al. 2000 experiments
$===============================================================================
$
*PARAMETER
$    PRMR1|     VAL1|
R F_SBTOUT       0.1
$ Termination time
*CONTROL_TERMINATION
$#  endtim    endcyc     dtmin    endeng    endmas
    300.00         0     0.000     0.000 1.0000E+8
$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Logging
$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*DATABASE_BINARY_D3PLOT
$#      dt      lcdt      beam     npltc    psetid
    5.0000         0         0         0         0
$#   ioopt
         0
*DATABASE_SBTOUT
$       DT|   BINARY|     LCUR|    IOOPT|
&F_SBTOUT                              1
$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$Positioning
$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$Constrain head Y-rotation, X- and Y-displacement in positioning phase
$Constrain thoracolumbar vertebrae in X during positioning
